  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Banco Mundo Mujer: Productive Financing for Microentrepreneurs in Colombia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the Project is to provide financing to microentrepreneurs located in municipal capitals, rural areas and urban areas of Colombia. To achieve this objective, the proposal is to grant a loan of up to US$20 million equal to about COP58.616 billion with a three-year term and a grace period of up to one year. This will allow Banco Mundo Mujer (&quot;BMM&quot;) to diversify its sources of financing and continue the growth of its portfolio in a strategic sector for IDB Invest.</narrative>
  </description>
